<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, flexDirection: "column", background: "#FFFFFF", fontFamily: 'Inter, "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 120, paddingLeft: 84, paddingRight: 84, flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", gap: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 5, height: 36, background: "#0B3D91" }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: "column" }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#0B1C33", lineHeight: 1.3 }}>让每个缺陷类在验证集里都有足够样本</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: "#9AA9B8", marginTop: 4 }}>全池 26243 张，按类分层重划分</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 540, paddingLeft: 84, paddingRight: 84, paddingTop: 12, paddingBottom: 20, flexDirection: "row", gap: 44 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 372, flexDirection: "column", gap: 14, paddingTop: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#0B1C33", lineHeight: 1.4 }}>旧划分的问题</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: "#5C6E82", lineHeight: 1.75 }}>原 val 里 16 个类的框数不足 100，个别类只有个位数——单类指标基本是噪声，弱类结论不可信。</Text>
            <Box style={{ padding: 16, background: "#F4F7FB", borderRadius: 10, borderLeft: "4px solid #00B4D8" }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: "#0B3D91", fontWeight: "bold", lineHeight: 1.7 }}>做法：小类留 50% 验证、中类 35%、大类 20%，保证每类都有足够样本。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: "column", gap: 10, marginTop: 4 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "center", paddingBottom: 8, borderBottom: "1px solid #E1E9F2" }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: "#5C6E82" }}>新 train</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#0B3D91" }}>20329</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "center", paddingBottom: 8, borderBottom: "1px solid #E1E9F2" }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: "#5C6E82" }}>新 val（cal / holdout）</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#0B3D91" }}>5911　(2891 / 3020)</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "center" }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: "#5C6E82" }}>39 类 val 框数下限</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#FF7A18" }}>≥ 30</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, minHeight: 400 }}>
                <Chart
                    style={{ width: "100%", height: "100%" }}
                    chartType="barChart"
                    barDirection="bar"
                    grouping="clustered"
                    title="新 val 中样本最少的 8 个类（框数）"
                    titleColor="#0B1C33"
                    showLegend={false}
                    showDataLabels={true}
                    dataLabelColor="#0B1C33"
                    axisColor="#9AA9B8"
                    background="#FFFFFF"
                    colors={["linear-gradient(90deg, #0B3D91 0%, #00B4D8 100%)"]}
                    data={[
                        ["缺陷类", "新 val 框数"],
                        ["oxide_scale_plate", 32],
                        ["striated_scale", 60],
                        ["blocky_scale", 62],
                        ["external_fold", 64],
                        ["iron_scale_compression", 65],
                        ["cutting_opening", 66],
                        ["longitudinal_crack", 66],
                        ["water_slag_mark", 67]
                    ]}
                />
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: "#9AA9B8", lineHeight: 1.6 }}>注：重划分修的是「评估可信度」，不是模型精度——尺子准了，之后测出来的数字才算数。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 60, paddingLeft: 84, paddingRight: 84, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "center", borderTop: "1px solid #E1E9F2" }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 24, height: 24, background: "#0B3D91", borderRadius: 4, alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "center" }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: "#FFFFFF", fontWeight: "bold" }}>DD</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: "#9AA9B8" }}>工业表面缺陷检测系统 · 周报</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: "#9AA9B8" }}>12 / 14</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
